'newsTag1':'Packaging Design Awards','newsTitle1':'DIELINE Awards 2026: Varus 775 wins Best of Show','newsDesc1':'OlssønBarbieri\'s Varus 775 spirits concept took the top honour - a glass bottle, aluminium refill and ceremonial porcelain vessel that turns historical storytelling into a circular packaging system.','newsTag2':'Packaging Design Awards','newsTitle2':'Prada, Jack Daniel\'s and Heinz win London Packaging Week Innovation Awards','newsDesc2':'This year\'s winners span F1-inspired luxury engineering, interactive launch packs and everyday food packaging - with Marks & Spencer named Packaging Team of the Year at Excel London.','newsTag3':'Packaging Design Awards','newsTitle3':'Pentawards 2026 winners: Meta Quest 3S takes Gold for eco-friendly unboxing','newsDesc3':'The Meta Quest 3S packaging was awarded Gold in the Home, Leisure & Other Markets category, praised for its eco-friendly, accessible design and unique unboxing experience.','newsTag4':'Packaging Design Awards','newsTitle4':'Eight Toyo Seikan packaging products win at the 2026 Japan Packaging Contest','newsDesc4':'Six group companies received the Packaging Technology Award and Packaging Category Award, showcasing advances in functional and sustainable container design.','newsTag5':'Packaging Design','newsTitle5':'2026 iF Design Award: sustainable packaging moves from material swap to structural redesign','newsDesc5':'Award-winning consumer packaging cases show designers asking better questions - can one sheet do more, can glue be removed, can one structure fit several products - turning structure itself into a sustainable solution.','newsTag6':'Packaging Design Research','newsTitle6':'Packaging redesigns see 4% average volume lift, NIQ finds','newsDesc6':'The 2026 NIQ Design Impact Awards show that well-executed packaging redesigns - from Aval Cider to Liquid I.V. - deliver an average 4% sales-volume uplift.','newsTag7':'Packaging Design Trends','newsTitle7':'2026 packaging design trends: sustainable minimalism takes over','newsDesc7':'Unbleached kraft, minimal ink coverage and textured finishes replace heavy printing - clean typography with maximum whitespace becomes the new premium look.','newsTag8':'Packaging Design Trends','newsTitle8':'Tactile Minimalism: the packaging trend bringing warmth to clean design','newsDesc8':'2026 packaging embraces clean layouts and simple shapes, brought together with warm colours and soft textures - every line, shade and material serves the brand\'s meaning.','newsTag9':'Packaging Design Trends','newsTitle9':'Molded pulp packaging: from alternative to advantage in 2026','newsDesc9':'Mono-material, low-ink design language makes moulded pulp a premium choice - fewer layers, fewer finishes, more confidence in shape and texture.','news':'News','newsSourcesTitle':'Sources','nav_news':'News','footerNews':'News'
